{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"github--awesome-copilot--code-tour","name":"code-tour","description":"Use this skill to create CodeTour .tour files — persona-targeted, step-by-step walkthroughs that link to real files and line numbers. Trigger for: \"create a tour\", \"make a code tour\", \"generate a tour\", \"onboarding tour\", \"tour for this PR\", \"tour for this bug\", \"RCA tour\", \"architecture tour\", \"explain how X works\", \"vibe check\", \"PR review tour\", \"contributor guide\", \"help someone ramp up\", or any request for a structured walkthrough through code. Supports 20 developer personas (new joiner, bug fixer, architect, PR reviewer, vibecoder, security reviewer, and more), all CodeTour step types (file/line, selection, pattern, uri, commands, view), and tour-level fields (ref, isPrimary, nextTour). Works with any repository in any language.","category":"Security","tags":["code","tour","skill","codetour",".tour","files","persona","targeted","step","by","walkthroughs","link","real","line","numbers.","trigger","generate","onboarding"],"repo":"github/awesome-copilot","owner":"github","stars":39345,"official":true,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"1f5644080a525d26a2e24f61a7609fb9b261c21a","path":"skills/code-tour","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/github/awesome-copilot/tree/1f5644080a525d26a2e24f61a7609fb9b261c21a/skills/code-tour","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T01:29:08Z","fileCount":6,"bytes":60541,"sha256":"365f0d06c564e6bb0f950a28f92e875780d4f0fef0ff6b86e05151a17f658f09","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"skills/code-tour/SKILL.md","bytes":22654,"sha256":"365f0d06c564e6bb0f950a28f92e875780d4f0fef0ff6b86e05151a17f658f09","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/github/awesome-copilot/1f5644080a525d26a2e24f61a7609fb9b261c21a/skills/code-tour/SKILL.md"},{"path":"references/codetour-schema.json","sourcePath":"skills/code-tour/references/codetour-s